  "items": [
    {
      "id": "69b6c788dd1a4c9c86f0bc00",
      "editionId": "69b55e8d6f42ba7ccb2a1322",
      "bookIndex": 37,
      "hadithIndex": 2515,
      "bookHadithIndex": 101,
      "text": "Anas narrated that the Prophet(s.a.w) said:\"None of you believes until he loves for his brother what he loves for himself",
      "grades": [
        {
          "id": "69b55e8d6f42ba7ccb2a1322-37-2515-ahmadmuhammadshakir",
          "name": "Ahmad Muhammad Shakir",
          "grade": "Sahih"
        },
        {
          "id": "69b55e8d6f42ba7ccb2a1322-37-2515-alalbani",
          "name": "Al-Albani",
          "grade": "Sahih"
        },
        {
          "id": "69b55e8d6f42ba7ccb2a1322-37-2515-basharawadmaarouf",
          "name": "Bashar Awad Maarouf",
          "grade": "Sahih"
        },
        {
          "id": "69b55e8d6f42ba7ccb2a1322-37-2515-zubairalizai",
          "name": "Zubair Ali Zai",
          "grade": "Sahih - Agreed Upon"
        }
      ]
    },
    {
      "id": "69b6c788dd1a4c9c86f0bc01",
      "editionId": "69b55e8d6f42ba7ccb2a1322",
      "bookIndex": 37,
      "hadithIndex": 2516,
      "bookHadithIndex": 102,
      "text": "Ibn 'Abbas narrated:\"I was behind the Prophet(s.a.w) one day when he said: 'O boy! I will teach you a statement: Be mindful of Allah and He will protect you. Be mindful of Allah and you will find Him before you. When you ask, ask Allah, and when you seek aid, seek Allah's aid. Know that if the entire creation were to gather together to do something to benefit you- you would never get any benefit except that Allah had written for you. And if they were to gather to do something to harm you- you would never be harmed except that Allah had written for you. The pens are lifted and the pages are dried",
      "grades": [
        {
          "id": "69b55e8d6f42ba7ccb2a1322-37-2516-ahmadmuhammadshakir",
          "name": "Ahmad Muhammad Shakir",
          "grade": "Sahih"
        },
        {
          "id": "69b55e8d6f42ba7ccb2a1322-37-2516-alalbani",
          "name": "Al-Albani",
          "grade": "Sahih"
        },
        {
          "id": "69b55e8d6f42ba7ccb2a1322-37-2516-basharawadmaarouf",
          "name": "Bashar Awad Maarouf",
          "grade": "Hasan Sahih"
        },
        {
          "id": "69b55e8d6f42ba7ccb2a1322-37-2516-zubairalizai",
          "name": "Zubair Ali Zai",
          "grade": "Isnaad Hasan"
        }
      ]
    },
    {
      "id": "69b6c788dd1a4c9c86f0bc02",
      "editionId": "69b55e8d6f42ba7ccb2a1322",
      "bookIndex": 37,
      "hadithIndex": 2517,
      "bookHadithIndex": 103,
      "text": "Anas bin Malik narrated that a man said:\"O Messenger of Allah! Shall I tie it and rely(upon Allah), or leave it loose and rely(upon Allah)?\" He said: \"Tie it and rely(upon Allah).\" Other chains report similar narrations",
      "grades": [
        {
          "id": "69b55e8d6f42ba7ccb2a1322-37-2517-ahmadmuhammadshakir",
          "name": "Ahmad Muhammad Shakir",
          "grade": "Hasan"
        },
        {
          "id": "69b55e8d6f42ba7ccb2a1322-37-2517-alalbani",
          "name": "Al-Albani",
          "grade": "Hasan"
        },
        {
          "id": "69b55e8d6f42ba7ccb2a1322-37-2517-zubairalizai",
          "name": "Zubair Ali Zai",
          "grade": "Hasan"
        }
      ]
    },
    {
      "id": "69b6c788dd1a4c9c86f0bc03",
      "editionId": "69b55e8d6f42ba7ccb2a1322",
      "bookIndex": 37,
      "hadithIndex": 2518,
      "bookHadithIndex": 104,
      "text": "Al-Hasan bin 'Ali said:\"I remember that the Messenger of Allah (s.a.w) said: 'Leave what makes you in doubt for what does not make you in doubt. The truth brings tranquility while falsehood sows doubt.'\" Another chain reports a similar narration",
      "grades": [
        {
          "id": "69b55e8d6f42ba7ccb2a1322-37-2518-ahmadmuhammadshakir",
          "name": "Ahmad Muhammad Shakir",
          "grade": "Sahih"
        },
        {
          "id": "69b55e8d6f42ba7ccb2a1322-37-2518-alalbani",
          "name": "Al-Albani",
          "grade": "Sahih"
        },
        {
          "id": "69b55e8d6f42ba7ccb2a1322-37-2518-zubairalizai",
          "name": "Zubair Ali Zai",
          "grade": "Isnaad Sahih"
        }
      ]
    },
    {
      "id": "69b6c788dd1a4c9c86f0bc04",
      "editionId": "69b55e8d6f42ba7ccb2a1322",
      "bookIndex": 37,
      "hadithIndex": 2519,
      "bookHadithIndex": 105,
      "text": "Muhammad bin Al-Munkadir narrated from Jabir, that a man was mentioned in the presence of the Prophet (s.a.w) for his worship and striving in it, and another man was mentioned for his cautious piety. So the Prophet (s.a.w) said:\"Nothing is equal to cautious piety",
      "grades": [
        {
          "id": "69b55e8d6f42ba7ccb2a1322-37-2519-ahmadmuhammadshakir",
          "name": "Ahmad Muhammad Shakir",
          "grade": "Daif"
        },
        {
          "id": "69b55e8d6f42ba7ccb2a1322-37-2519-alalbani",
          "name": "Al-Albani",
          "grade": "Daif"
        },
        {
          "id": "69b55e8d6f42ba7ccb2a1322-37-2519-zubairalizai",
          "name": "Zubair Ali Zai",
          "grade": "Daif"
        }
      ]
    },
    {
      "id": "69b6c788dd1a4c9c86f0bc05",
      "editionId": "69b55e8d6f42ba7ccb2a1322",
      "bookIndex": 37,
      "hadithIndex": 2520,
      "bookHadithIndex": 106,
      "text": "Abu Sa'eed Al-Khudri narrated that the Messenger of Allah (s.a.w) said:\"Whoever eats the Tayyib and acts in accordance with the Sunnah, and the people are safe from his harm, he will enter Paradise.\" So a man said: \"O Messenger of Allah! This is the case with many people today.\" So he said: \"It shall be so in the generation after me",
      "grades": [
        {
          "id": "69b55e8d6f42ba7ccb2a1322-37-2520-ahmadmuhammadshakir",
          "name": "Ahmad Muhammad Shakir",
          "grade": "Daif"
        },
        {
          "id": "69b55e8d6f42ba7ccb2a1322-37-2520-alalbani",
          "name": "Al-Albani",
          "grade": "Daif"
        },
        {
          "id": "69b55e8d6f42ba7ccb2a1322-37-2520-zubairalizai",
          "name": "Zubair Ali Zai",
          "grade": "Daif"
        }
      ]
    },
    {
      "id": "69b6c788dd1a4c9c86f0bc06",
      "editionId": "69b55e8d6f42ba7ccb2a1322",
      "bookIndex": 37,
      "hadithIndex": 2521,
      "bookHadithIndex": 107,
      "text": "Sahl bin Mu'adh[bin Anas] Al-Juhni narrated from his father that the Prophet (s.a.w) said:\"Whoever gives for the sake of Allah, withholds for the sake of Allah, loves for the sake of Allah, hates for the sake of Allah, and marries for the sake of Allah, he has indeed perfected his faith",
      "grades": [
        {
          "id": "69b55e8d6f42ba7ccb2a1322-37-2521-ahmadmuhammadshakir",
          "name": "Ahmad Muhammad Shakir",
          "grade": "Hasan"
        },
        {
          "id": "69b55e8d6f42ba7ccb2a1322-37-2521-alalbani",
          "name": "Al-Albani",
          "grade": "Hasan"
        },
        {
          "id": "69b55e8d6f42ba7ccb2a1322-37-2521-zubairalizai",
          "name": "Zubair Ali Zai",
          "grade": "Isnaad Hasan"
        }
      ]
    },
    {
      "id": "69b6c788dd1a4c9c86f0bc07",
      "editionId": "69b55e8d6f42ba7ccb2a1322",
      "bookIndex": 37,
      "hadithIndex": 2522,
      "bookHadithIndex": 108,
      "text": "Abu Sa'eed Al-Khudri narrated that the Prophet (s.a.w) said:\"The first batch to enter Paradise will appear like the moon of a night that is full. The second will appear like the color of the most beautiful star in the sky. Each man among them shall have two wives, each wife wearing seventy bracelets, with the marrow of their shins being visible from behind them",
      "grades": [
        {
          "id": "69b55e8d6f42ba7ccb2a1322-37-2522-alalbani",
          "name": "Al-Albani",
          "grade": "Sahih"
        },
        {
          "id": "69b55e8d6f42ba7ccb2a1322-37-2522-basharawadmaarouf",
          "name": "Bashar Awad Maarouf",
          "grade": "Hasan Sahih"
        },
        {
          "id": "69b55e8d6f42ba7ccb2a1322-37-2522-zubairalizai",
          "name": "Zubair Ali Zai",
          "grade": "Sahih"
        }
      ]
    }
  ]
}